# Environment Variables for IRIS Translator

# Google Gemini API Key (Primary LLM Provider)
# Get your API key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# SECURITY: Never commit this file with real API keys!
# Add .env to .gitignore to keep your keys safe
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# The application will gracefully fall back to:
# 1. Hugging Face Inference API (free, no key needed)
# 2. Together AI (free, no key needed)
# 3. Local demo translations (offline mode)
# if Gemini API is not configured or unavailable.
